  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap NgHivLocalToSNOMEDCT</b></p><a name=\"NgHivLocalToSNOMEDCT\"> </a><a name=\"hcNgHivLocalToSNOMEDCT\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-hiv-local-concepts.html\">Nigeria HIV Local Concepts</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-hiv-snomed-ct-concepts.html\">Nigeria HIV SNOMED CT Concepts</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-art-follow-up-status-cs.html\">HIV Follow Up Status CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>alive-on-art</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>129019007 (Taking medication)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-positive-tracking-cs.html\">HIV Positive Tracking</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Not-Started (ART Not Started)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>410524007 (Was not started)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-service-provider-cs.html\">HIV Service Providers CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Health-Center</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>257622000 (Healthcare facility)</td></tr><tr><td>Public-Hospital</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>276052003 (Public facilities)</td></tr><tr><td>Private-Hospital</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>309895006 (Private hospital)</td></tr><tr><td>NBO-FBO-Hospital (NBO/FBO hospital)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>394794000 (Health clinic managed by voluntary or private agents)</td></tr><tr><td>Private-Clinic</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>185483006 (Outreach clinic)</td></tr><tr><td>Self-referred</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1991000124105 (Referred by self)</td></tr><tr><td>Community-Referred</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>310391008 (Community clinic)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 4 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-target-population-category-cs.html\">Target Population Category Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>MSM</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>76102007 (Male homosexual)</td></tr><tr><td>Female-Commercial-Sex-Workers</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>159799000 (Female prostitute)</td></tr><tr><td>TG</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>407375002 (Surgically transgendered transsexual)</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile-Daily-Laborers (Mobile or Daily Laborers)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>106540006 (Laborer)</td></tr><tr><td>Distance-Drivers</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>87447002 (Lorry and van driver (long-distance transport))</td></tr><tr><td>Refugee</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>446654005 (Refugee)</td></tr><tr><td>People-Who-Inject-Drug</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>226034001 (Injecting drug user)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 5 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-enhanced-adherence-counselling-status-cs.html\">Enhanced Adherence Counselling</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>eac (Enhanced Adherence Counselling)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>410265008 (Medication administration education, guidance, and counseling)</td></tr></table></div>"
